{
  "id": "fluency-l14-splitting-fractions",
  "lesson": "l14-splitting-fractions",
  "title": "Fluency: partial fractions",
  "n": 20,
  "pass": 0.9,
  "minutes": 12,
  "families": [
    {
      "id": "cover-up",
      "weight": 1,
      "skill": "find a coefficient by cover-up",
      "vars": {
        "ca": { "int": [-5, 5], "not": [0] },
        "cb": { "int": [-5, 5], "not": [0] },
        "a": { "int": [-4, 4], "not": [0] },
        "b": { "int": [-4, 4], "not": [0] }
      },
      "let": { "s": "ca + cb", "t0": "-(ca*b + cb*a)", "na": "ca*(a - b)" },
      "where": ["a != b", "ca != cb", "a - b != 1", "na != cb"],
      "prompt": "Find $A$ in $\\displaystyle\\frac{{{poly(x; s, t0)}}}{{(x{-a:+})(x{-b:+})}} = \\frac{{A}}{{x{-a:+}}} + \\frac{{B}}{{x{-b:+}}}$.",
      "widget": { "kind": "numeric", "answer": "{ca}", "tol": { "abs": 0 } },
      "wrong": [
        { "id": "other-factor", "value": "{cb}", "line": "That is $B$. For $A$, cover up $x{-a:+}$ and put $x = {a}$." },
        { "id": "no-divide", "value": "{na}", "line": "At $x = {a}$ the top is {na}. Divide it by the other factor, ${a - b}$, to get $A$." }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "Clear the bottoms: ${poly(x; s, t0)} = A(x{-b:+}) + B(x{-a:+})$.",
        "Put $x = {a}$, which removes the $B$ term: ${na} = A \\times {a - b:()}$, so $A = {ca}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "split-integrate",
      "weight": 2,
      "skill": "split, then integrate the pieces",
      "vars": {
        "ca": { "int": [-5, 5], "not": [0] },
        "cb": { "int": [-5, 5], "not": [0] },
        "a": { "int": [-5, 3], "not": [0] },
        "d": { "int": [1, 5] },
        "v": { "pick": ["x", "t"] }
      },
      "let": { "b": "a + d", "s": "ca + cb", "t0": "-(ca*b + cb*a)", "na": "ca*(a - b)", "nb": "cb*(b - a)" },
      "where": ["b != 0", "ca != cb", "ca != -cb"],
      "prompt": "Find $\\displaystyle\\int \\frac{{{poly(v; s, t0)}}}{{({v}{-a:+})({v}{-b:+})}}\\,d{v}$.",
      "widget": { "kind": "expression", "answer": "{ca:c}\\ln|{v}{-a:+}|{cb:+c}\\ln|{v}{-b:+}|", "upToConstant": true, "keyboard": "calculus" },
      "wrong": [
        { "id": "swapped", "tex": "{cb:c}\\ln|{v}{-a:+}|{ca:+c}\\ln|{v}{-b:+}|", "line": "Each coefficient belongs to the factor you covered up to find it: $A = {ca}$ goes with ${v}{-a:+}$." },
        { "id": "sign-flip", "tex": "{-ca:c}\\ln|{v}{-a:+}|{-cb:+c}\\ln|{v}{-b:+}|", "line": "Check the cover-up: at ${v} = {a}$ the other factor is ${a - b}$, not ${b - a}$." }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "Split as $\\frac{{A}}{{{v}{-a:+}}} + \\frac{{B}}{{{v}{-b:+}}}$.",
        "Cover-up: at ${v} = {a}$, ${na} = A \\times {a - b:()}$, so $A = {ca}$. At ${v} = {b}$, ${nb} = B \\times {b - a:()}$, so $B = {cb}$.",
        "Each piece integrates to a logarithm: ${ca:c}\\ln|{v}{-a:+}|{cb:+c}\\ln|{v}{-b:+}| + C$."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
